From 466e500db134efb2090d52b9b6b1104ce43e8ed2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Srinivas Kandagatla <srinivas.kandagatla@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:39:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-firmware: qcom: sync audioreach firmwares from v1.0.5
 build

Update audioreach tplg firmwares to latest builds from v1.0.5 of
https://github.com/linux-msm/audioreach-topology

What's Changed in v1.0.5:
  - Add initial topology for Nord (NORD-RIDE and NORD-RRD)
  - Add initial topology for Hawi and Maili MTP
  - Add initial topology for Shikra IQS and CQS EVK
  - Add initial topology for Eliza CQS EVK (reusing SM8550 topology)
  - Add topology for Microsoft Surface Pro 11
  - Add topology for Lenovo IdeaCentre Mini (X1E80100)
  - Add topology for Lenovo ThinkPad T14s Gen 7 (Glymur)
  - Add topology for ASUS Zenbook A14 UX3407NA and A16 UX3607OA (Glymur)
  - Add topology for Acer Swift 14 AI (SF14-11)
  - Add support for Radxa Dragon Q8B (SC8280XP)
  - X1E80100-CRD: add DISPLAY_PORT_RX_2 playback path
  - sc8280xp-x13s: add dedicated MultiMedia FEs for DisplayPort
  - Add I2S on 40 Pin JHAT connector on Arduino VENTUNO-Q
  - Rename TUXEDO Elite 14 to Medion SPRCHRGD 14 S1

Detailed change log available at:
	https://github.com/linux-msm/audioreach-topology/releases/tag/v1.0.5

Signed-off-by: Srinivas Kandagatla <srinivas.kandagatla@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/commit/?id=466e500db134efb2090d52b9b6b1104ce43e8ed2]
